      "text": "SaaS Subscription Agreement\nI. Subscription Grant\nSubject to payment of the applicable fees, the Provider grants the Customer a non-exclusive, non-transferable right to access and use the hosted service during the subscription term.\n\nII. Service Levels\nThe Provider shall make the hosted service available at least 99.9 percent of the time in each calendar month, excluding scheduled maintenance windows notified in advance.\n\nIII. Fees and Payment\nSubscription fees are billed annually in advance and are non-refundable except as expressly stated in this Agreement.\n\nIV. Customer Data\nAs between the parties, the Customer owns all Customer Data, and the Provider processes Customer Data only to provide the hosted service.\n\nV. Acceptable Use\nThe Customer shall not use the hosted service to store or transmit unlawful content or attempt to gain unauthorised access to any part of the service.\n\nVI. Suspension and Termination\nThe Provider may suspend the hosted service immediately if continued use poses a security risk and may terminate this Agreement for material breach not cured within thirty days of notice."
